WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Home brings pinned platforms and a Resume card together.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
Browse ten platforms in Discover. See what is installed, pinned or available.

00:14.000 --> 00:21.000
Inspect a platform first. Installs require an explicit action.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
Pin a platform without installing it. Remove a pin without uninstalling.

00:28.000 --> 00:35.000
Choose Automatic, Game input or Desktop navigation in Settings.

00:35.000 --> 00:42.000
Seven draft interface languages, including Arabic with right-to-left layout.

00:42.000 --> 00:49.000
Show Home at login if you choose. AntiMicroX set switching is opt-in.

00:49.000 --> 00:56.000
Help test a handheld, review a translation, or build a focused improvement.
Actual app UI with simulated session and controller state. Not gameplay footage.
